{"id":"631569","name":"槐花土豆包","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631569/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土豆","amount":"2个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"2g"}],"sub":[{"name":"干面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土豆去皮洗净。","img":"images/631569/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用擦刀磨成细末。","img":"images/631569/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放些许清水。","img":"images/631569/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"开中火煮，一边煮一边搅拌，免得糊锅底。","img":"images/631569/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"这个状态就是熟了，有点跟凉粉似的。","img":"images/631569/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放冷水，拌匀。","img":"images/631569/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放酵母拌匀。","img":"images/631569/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放面粉，揉成面团。","img":"images/631569/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放温暖处发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/631569/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"取槐花，撰干水分备用。","img":"images/631569/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/631569/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"油热放槐花翻炒，炒出水汽放猪油。","img":"images/631569/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"炒匀放食盐。","img":"images/631569/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"炒均匀关火。","img":"images/631569/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放肉糜搅拌均匀。","img":"images/631569/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放葱姜末和生抽。","img":"images/631569/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/631569/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/631569/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"取出发好的面揉光排气。","img":"images/631569/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"分成约50克一个的剂子。","img":"images/631569/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/631569/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"包包子。","img":"images/631569/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"全部包好入蒸笼二次发酵。","img":"images/631569/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"二次发好的包子大火烧开。","img":"images/631569/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"中火蒸20分钟焖几分钟即可。","img":"images/631569/step_25.jpg"},{"step":26,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631569/step_26.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}